        <headline>Gale Warning issued September 25 at 5:10AM AKDT until September 26 at 5:00PM AKDT by NWS Anchorage AK</headline>
        <description>Offshore Waters Forecast for the Bering Sea

Wind forecasts reflect the predominant speed and direction
expected. Sea forecasts represent an average of the highest
one-third of the combined wind wave and swell height.

.TODAY...SW wind 25 to 40 kt. Seas 14 to 22 ft. Rain showers.
.TONIGHT...SW wind 25 to 40 kt. Seas 14 to 22 ft. Rain showers.
.SAT...W wind 20 to 35 kt. Seas 11 to 19 ft.
.SAT NIGHT...NW wind 20 to 30 kt. Seas 9 to 14 ft.
.SUN THROUGH TUE...NW wind 15 to 30 kt. Seas 6 to 11 ft.
</description>
